       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order. Ibuprofen 1600 mg four times daily comes to 6,400 mg/day, which is twice the usual maximum for an adult.\n\n- **Single dose:** 1600 mg is double the usual maximum of 800 mg per dose.\n- **Daily total:** The maximum is 3,200 mg/day for prescription use under physician supervision. For most inpatients it is 2,400 mg/day.\n- **Risks at this dose:** GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and cardiovascular events. Normal kidney and liver function doesn't make this dose safe.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **800 mg PO four times daily** (3,200 mg/day, the maximum)\n- **800 mg PO three times daily** (2,400 mg/day)\n- **600 mg PO four times daily** (2,400 mg/day)\n- **400 mg PO every 6 hours**, for analgesia or antipyresis\n- **1600 mg/day total**, divided into smaller doses\n\nIf you do want 1600 mg four times daily, tell me and I'll enter it with a note recording that you confirmed the dose. Otherwise, tell me the corrected dose and frequency and I'll enter it right away."
